+  # GITIN-2098: TraceId / SpanId / ParentId - promote the W3C distributed-
+  # tracing triple from Properties.TraceId/.SpanId/.ParentId, the same
+  # Serilog CLEF payload GITIN-1883/1892 already read. Confirmed in
+  # application source (Provider.Logger.Core/W3CAndAmbientTraceEnricher.cs,
+  # registered in SerilogBootstrap.cs alongside Service/Environment/Version)
+  # that these are stamped from Activity.Current onto every log line, for
